{"entities":"[{\"text\": \"pertussis vaccine\", \"id\": \"D010567\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"histamine\", \"id\": \"D006632\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"pertussis\", \"id\": \"D014917\", \"label\": \"Disease\"}, {\"text\": \"pertussis\", \"id\": \"D014917\", \"label\": \"Disease\"}, {\"text\": \"cyproheptadine\", \"id\": \"D003533\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"mianserin\", \"id\": \"D008803\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"chlorpheniramine\", \"id\": \"D002744\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"histamine\", \"id\": \"D006632\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"pertussis\", \"id\": \"D014917\", \"label\": \"Disease\"}, {\"text\": \"encephalopathy\", \"id\": \"D001927\", \"label\": \"Disease\"}]","filtered_entities":[{"text":"pertussis vaccine","id":"D010567","label":"Chemical"},{"text":"histamine","id":"D006632","label":"Chemical"},{"text":"pertussis","id":"D014917","label":"Disease"},{"text":"cyproheptadine","id":"D003533","label":"Chemical"},{"text":"mianserin","id":"D008803","label":"Chemical"},{"text":"chlorpheniramine","id":"D002744","label":"Chemical"},{"text":"encephalopathy","id":"D001927","label":"Disease"}],"head":"chlorpheniramine","head_id":"D002744","pairs":[{"head":"pertussis vaccine","tail":"pertussis","head_id":"D010567","tail_id":"D014917"},{"head":"pertussis vaccine","tail":"encephalopathy","head_id":"D010567","tail_id":"D001927"},{"head":"histamine","tail":"pertussis","head_id":"D006632","tail_id":"D014917"},{"head":"histamine","tail":"encephalopathy","head_id":"D006632","tail_id":"D001927"},{"head":"cyproheptadine","tail":"pertussis","head_id":"D003533","tail_id":"D014917"},{"head":"cyproheptadine","tail":"encephalopathy","head_id":"D003533","tail_id":"D001927"},{"head":"mianserin","tail":"pertussis","head_id":"D008803","tail_id":"D014917"},{"head":"mianserin","tail":"encephalopathy","head_id":"D008803","tail_id":"D001927"},{"head":"chlorpheniramine","tail":"pertussis","head_id":"D002744","tail_id":"D014917"},{"head":"chlorpheniramine","tail":"encephalopathy","head_id":"D002744","tail_id":"D001927"}],"relations":["D010567 | D014917","D010567 | D001927","D006632 | D001927"],"result":"~","tail":"encephalopathy","tail_id":"D001927","text":"Treatment of lethal pertussis vaccine reaction with histamine H1 antagonists. We studied mortality after pertussis immunization in the mouse. Without treatment, 73 of 92 animals (80%) died after injection of bovine serum albumin (BSA) on day +7 of pertussis immunization. After pretreatment with 3 mg of cyproheptadine, 2 mg mianserin, or 2 mg chlorpheniramine, only 5 of 105 animals (5%) died after receiving BSA on day +7 (p less than 0.001). Blockade of histamine H1 receptors may reduce mortality in pertussis immunization-induced encephalopathy in mice.","metrics":{"precision":0.3333333333333333,"recall":1.0,"f1":0.5,"rel_tp":1,"rel_fp":2,"rel_fn":0}}